; Stage 2b: Help key ($5F) on the token NPrint (line 3): the screen title
; shows the help text of blitz2's token list (dump header).  Nothing saved.
; @source T t01_int
; @expect same t01_int.bb2
; @expect absent t01_int.bb2.bak
; @est 3
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
key 4d
key 4d
key 5f
dump help
menu 0 9
wait exit
